Error [jet.InvalidEmbedPath]: `find` glob can't use `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_find_dotdot.jet:1:19
    |
  1 | PATHS: #run find("../*.jet")
    |                   ^^^^
 Why: Comptime inputs are named from this file's own directory down, so a build can audit them; `..` is refused even when it names a file inside the package
 Fix: Drop the `..` and use a glob under this file's directory
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0957
